{"id":"1999896955036406673","kind":"article","title":"Execute Program 没有不可执行的卡片","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zYCRKm7HujiD6CNtcC9gnmk"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2026-01-28","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":1,"comment_count":0,"minutes":2,"chars":765,"keywords":["间隔重复","可执行练习","编程教育","应用卡片","概念学习"],"summary":"作者说明 Execute Program 的交互卡片要求读者实际执行代码来回答，因此该课程只包含可执行的“应用卡片”，不能容纳解释正则表达式概念等传统问答卡。文章以此指出，面向操作技能的练习模式不适合主要依赖概念分析的课程。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1999896955036406673","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"参考资料"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"5IDh7jS0\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z9DRugkwcBv7iLRACEnWVDL\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">读者通过执行程序来回答 Execute Program 的交互卡片</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>。<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zSsjk5UvNPGrYp8B6DEFCMS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Execute Program</a> 不包含任何其他类型的卡片。</p><p data-pid=\"Rgl2UzD7\">例如，一节关于正则表达式的课程可能会有这样一个卡片：</p><blockquote data-pid=\"7tmgXRY_\">Q. <code>/a..b/.test(“a\\ncb”)</code> 的输出是什么？ <br/>A. <code>false</code></blockquote><p data-pid=\"Lsj6EIfr\">读者需要通过在 REPL 中实际输入 <code>false</code> 并执行该表达式来回答这个卡片。</p><p data-pid=\"fq0WfZ-E\">该课程也就无法包含这类更典型的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2D1qPwddPktBjpNuwYFVva\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆系统</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>卡片：</p><blockquote data-pid=\"lkOMiClt\">Q. <code>.</code> <b>不</b>匹配哪些字符（在许多实现中）？ <br/>A. <code>\\n</code> </blockquote><p data-pid=\"DPACTX0j\">主要涉及概念的课程（例如 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.executeprogram.com/courses/sql/lessons/constraint-analysis\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SQL 约束分析</a>）很难适配这种模式。</p><p data-pid=\"bII6JzWs\">正因为 Execute Program 只有一种卡片类型：<a class=\"wrap external\" data-draft-title=\"Execute Program 的卡片既是应用卡片，也是回忆卡片\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zUoZHzEPeQFKaUTYctg9fqq\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Execute Program 的卡片既是应用卡片，也是回忆卡片</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>。</p><hr/><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><p data-pid=\"oz2gM-fj\">Q. 请举一个 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/Execute_Program\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Execute Program</a> 无法编码的卡片的例子？ <br/>A. lass<code>=</code>\"nolink\"&gt;例如：「Q<code>.</code> * 和 + 之间的区别是什么？ A. * 允许零次匹配」</p><p data-pid=\"r4etLpVD\">Q. 为什么 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/Execute_Program\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Execute Program</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup> 的 SQL 约束分析课程无法利用其间隔重复系统？ <br/>A. 该课程主要是概念性的，其中的想法难以被编码为可执行的表达式。</p><hr/><h2 id=\"sec-1\"><b>参考资料</b></h2><p data-pid=\"drrsiz6i\">与 Gary Bernhardt 的对话，2020-03-24</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"6Niixc95\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1999149514427213729\" href=\"#/post/1999149514427213729\">读者通过执行程序来回答 Execute Program 的交互卡片</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-3\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"LmxKl2KQ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 gemini-3-pro-preview，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zYCRKm7HujiD6CNtcC9gnmk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Execute Program doesn’t have non-executable prompts</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 读者通过执行程序来回答 Execute Program 的交互卡片 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1999149514427213729\" href=\"#/post/1999149514427213729\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 间隔重复记忆系统（Spaced repetition memory system） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"404257681\" href=\"#/post/404257681\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> Execute Program 的卡片既是应用卡片，也是回忆卡片 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"2000259693428351079\" href=\"#/post/2000259693428351079\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> Execute Program <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"2003900630289379481\" href=\"#/post/2003900630289379481\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"1999149514427213729","title":"读者通过执行程序来回答 Execute Program 的交互卡片","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":2,"minutes":3,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"2000259693428351079","title":"Execute Program 的卡片既是应用卡片，也是回忆卡片","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"2003900630289379481","title":"Execute Program","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":11,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"404257681","title":"间隔重复记忆系统（Spaced repetition memory system）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":88,"minutes":16,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}